TITLE Kinetic dissolution of Calcite - built-in rate with parms 10.0 and 0.001

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      0.5
    Mn        1.0

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -tol    1e-8
    -m0     1.0
    -m      1.0
    -parms  10.0  0.001
    -steps  1000 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_kinetic4.sel
    -reset  false
    -time   true
    -pH     true
    -si     Calcite  Aragonite

END
